ion of an order.\"}]]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\",\"children\":\"6. Data Retention\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We retain your account data for as long as your account is active. Order records are retained for 7 years as required by Indian tax law (GST). You may request deletion of your account and associated personal data at any time by contacting us — we will process your request within 30 days, subject to legal retention requirements.\"}]]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\",\"children\":\"7. Security\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We use industry-standard security measures including TLS encryption in transit, hashed tokens, and role-based access controls. Payment data is handled exclusively by PCI-compliant Razorpay — we never store card details on our servers. However, no system is 100% secure and we cannot guarantee absolute security.\"}]]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\",\"children\":\"8. Push Notifications\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"With your permission, we send push notifications for order updates, promotions, and account activity. You can disable notifications at any time in your device settings or in the app's notification preferences screen. Promotional notifications are automatically suppressed between 10pm and 8am.\"}]]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\",\"children\":\"9. Your Rights\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2\",\"children\":\"Under applicable Indian law (IT Act 2000, Consumer Protection Act 2019), you have the right to:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-1 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-400\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"