hare, and protect your personal information when you use our website (go2qt.com) and mobile applications. By using our Service, you consent to the practices described here.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\",\"children\":\"2. Information We Collect\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white mb-1\",\"children\":\"Information you provide:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-1 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-400\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Phone number (used for authentication via OTP)\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Name and delivery addresses\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Payment information (processed securely by Razorpay — we do not store card details)\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Order history and preferences\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Support ticket messages and feedback\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white mb-1\",\"children\":\"Information collected automatically:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-1 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-400\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Device type, OS version, and app version\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"IP address and approximate location (for zone detection)\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Precise location when you use delivery tracking (only during active orders)\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Notification interaction data (sent, opened, clicked)\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Crash reports and performance logs\"}]]}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\",\"children\":\"3. How We Use Your Information\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-400\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"To create and manage your account\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"To process and deliver your orders\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"To send order status notifications via push, WhatsApp, or SMS\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"To process payments and refunds\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"To detect and prevent fraud\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"To improve our products and services\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"To send promotional communications (you can opt out at any time)\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"To comply with legal obligations\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\",\"children\":\"4. Information Sharing\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2\",\"children\":\"We do not sell your personal information. We share your data only with:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-400\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-zinc-300\",\"children\":\"Delivery riders:\"}],\" Your name, phone number (masked), and delivery address for order fulfilment.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-zinc-300\",\"children\":\"Kitchen partners:\"}],\" Your order details (no personal contact info) for preparation.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-zinc-300\",\"children\":\"Payment processor (Razorpay):\"}],\" For transaction processing, governed by Razorpay's privacy policy.\"]}],\"$L3\",\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\"]}]]}],\"$L7\",\"$L8\",\"$L9\",\"$La\",\"$Lb\",\"$Lc\",\"$Ld\",\"$Le\"]}]]}]}],[\"$Lf\"],\"$L10\"]}],\"isPartial\":false,\"staleTime\":300,\"varyParams\":null,\"buildId\":\"g9p7z4UnDbeEKGBJ3whsF\"}\n3:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-zinc-300\",\"children\":\"Communication providers (MSG91, Interakt):\"}],\" Your phone number, for OTP and WhatsApp order notifications.\"]}]\n4:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-zinc-300\",\"children\":\"Firebase (Google):\"}],\" For authentication and push notifications.\"]}]\n5:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-zinc-300\",\"children\":\"ImageKit:\"}],\" For image hosting and delivery.\"]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-zinc-300\",\"children\":\"Law enforcement:\"}],\" When required by law or to protect rights and safety.\"]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\",\"children\":\"5. Location Data\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We request location permission only to detect your delivery zone during login and to enable live rider tracking during active orders. We do not track your location in the background. Precise location data is not stored beyond the duration of an order.\"}]]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\",\"children\":\"6. Data Retention\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We retain your account data for as long as your account is active. Order records are retained for 7 years as required by Indian tax law (GST). You may request deletion of your account and associated personal data at any time by contacting us — we will process your request within 30 days, subject to legal retention requirements.\"}]]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\",\"children\":\"7. Security\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We use industry-standard security measures including TLS encryption in transit, hashed tokens, and role-based access controls. Payment data is handled exclusively by PCI-compliant Razorpay — we never store card details on our servers. However, no system is 100% secure and we cannot guarantee absolute security.\"}]]}]\na:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\",\"children\":\"8. Push Notifications\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"With your permission, we send push notifications for order updates, promotions, and account activity. You can disable notifications at any time in your device settings or in the app's notification preferences screen. Promotional notifications are automatically suppressed between 10pm and 8am.\"}]]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\",\"children\":\"9. Your Rights\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2\",\"children\":\"Under applicable Indian law (IT Act 2000, Consumer Protection Act 2019), you have the right to:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-1 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-400\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Access the personal data we hold about you\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Correct inaccurate data\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Request deletion of your data (subject to legal retention requirements)\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Opt out of promotional communications\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":[\"Contact \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"mailto:support@go2qt.com\",\"className\":\"text-[#FF6B35] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"support@go2qt.com\"}],\" to exercise these rights.\"]}]]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\",\"children\":\"10. Children's Privacy\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Our Service is not directed at children under 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided